    "tie_break": "lexicographically smallest job-ID sequence among objectives equal within 1e-9",
    "classical_baseline_note": "For this single-machine weighted-completion objective, nonincreasing service-value/duration (Smith WSPT rule) is already optimal; the oracle verifies implementation and measures alternative heuristics, not novelty."
